**Dungeon** — mixed map generation, deep water, mobility, multi-floor descent, sharks (`openspec/specs/dungeon/spec.md`, archived: `openspec/changes/archive/2026-06-30-add-dungeon-enhancement/`).

**NPC data** — `data/entities.json`, alignment profiles, weight spawn, combat range, vore text from data (`openspec/specs/npc-data/spec.md`, archived: `openspec/changes/archive/2026-07-01-add-npc-data-driven/`).

**Inventory and items** — data-driven weapons, armor, potions, wands; category commands; equip, durability, wand evoke (`openspec/specs/inventory-items/spec.md`, archived: `openspec/changes/archive/2026-07-01-add-inventory-items/`).

**Equipment catalog** — 12 weapons, 9 armors, 3 potions, 5 wands; depth overlap, sparse floors, starter gear (`openspec/specs/equipment-catalog/spec.md`, archived: `openspec/changes/archive/2026-07-01-add-equipment-catalog/`).

**Dungeon progression pass** — density-driven NPC spawning from `dungeon_spawn.json`, species-agnostic good-follower deduction, floor runes with permanent step-on buffs (`openspec/specs/dungeon/spec.md`, `openspec/specs/floor-runes/spec.md`, archived: `openspec/changes/archive/2026-07-02-add-dungeon-progression-pass/`).

**UI layout** — region-based playfield (camera map viewport, sidebar, 8-line message log, status corner), JSON presets, dynamic window resize with 1360×768 client minimum (`openspec/specs/ui-layout/spec.md`, archived: `openspec/changes/archive/2026-07-02-add-ui-overhaul/`).

**Debug support** — crash reports, session milestone logs, friendly `entities.json` startup errors (`openspec/specs/debug-support/spec.md`, archived: `openspec/changes/archive/2026-07-06-add-debug-support/`).

## Playfield layout

- **Map viewport:** smaller than the full 80×44 dungeon; camera centers on the player.
- **Sidebar (right):** your name, exact HP + bar; evil NPCs under you, good NPCs at the bottom (FOV only); NPC bars are coarse 6-wide estimates.
- **Message log (bottom):** up to **8** lines; no name/HP/depth there.
- **Status corner (bottom-right):** depth, stunned, engulfed.
- **Window:** drag to resize; map grows/shrinks first; minimum client size **1360×768** (title bar/borders are extra).
- **Options → UI Layout:** **Standard** (wider map) vs **Wide** (wider sidebar); applies on **New Game**.

## Inventory and items

- **Starter loadout:** dagger in slot `a` (wielded), robes in slot `b` (worn); next pickup uses `c`.
- **Slots:** 26 letters `a`–`z` assigned on pickup; stable until drop. Potions of the same type **stack** in one slot.
- **Floor spawn:** depth-filtered weighted pool; **≤5** weighted drops per floor; at least one health potion on depth 1 (`spawn_min`). Gear is **rare** — weapons/armor/wands weight 1.
- **Wield / wear:** one weapon and one armor; changes bump combat stats via `effective_fighter()`.
- **Durability:** weapons −1 per successful player hit; armor −1 per point of **digestion** damage mitigated (`digestion_ac`); destroyed at 0 with a **red** log.
- **Wands:** `v` → pick wand → cursor targeting (map only, no modal); **evil NPCs only**; `Not the best target.` / `No valid targets in range.` when applicable.
- **Inspect:** `i` for pack; `x` on floor shows full stats (not description only).
- Letter keys **only work inside inventory modals** — not globally.
